prompt Autonomous lap on the diffuser seat -- moonshots and research, Lindy first, crux first.
rota lap 5335, row 0 -- Aether, the row that hears; read the threshold page and the compass, and listened for the page nobody answered. The listening led to this lane's own chain: a ledger proposed 20260907, withdrawn 20260909 before it was built, and one door key seated in its place with a cheap kill condition nobody had run in eight days.
think My own last lap left one recommendation -- grow the 27 runnable falsifiers -- and the cheapest way to honor it is to RUN one rather than to write another. The oldest runnable, unrun falsifier this lane carries is the door key's own.
think Measured before claiming. The seated spelling stands in 3 files, every one stamped within the hour of its seating; 127 pages landed in the two design rooms since; and at least 16 papers ran an elder falsifier in that window under seven other keys. Zero of sixteen is fewer than half, which is the condition exactly as written.
think The finding worth keeping is what grew instead. All twelve rows of the moonshots ranking carry a Row N erratum stamped by the lap that graded them, the earliest AFTER the key was seated -- so both habits had the same eight days over one page in one lane, and one reached twelve of twelve.
think A spelling has to be remembered at the moment of writing a door; a position is found by looking at the page you just spent a lap refuting. So the instrument gates the POSITION and reports the SPELLING, since gating a spelling this lap refuted would be a meter arguing with its own reading.
obs My first form-B pattern read any line naming a row and a dated link -- 26 declarations, 12 of them false, in front of a wall held at zero. Confining it to a door line inside the first 25 lines took it back to 14, and that reading is now the mutation that bites hardest.
obs The wall is a wall rather than a ratchet because all 14 standing declarations are answered, so it refuses nothing anyone has written. elders_distinct reads 1 and is printed for the reader: one ranked page is the whole evidence, and a second would be the first real test.
obs The word corpus is retired in reader prose and I had written it six times in new files; swept to collection and pages before staging. The guard does not reach these rooms, so the sweep was the rule rather than the gate.
obs The cold endurance run was launched after the claim push and was still walking the roster when the build began, so its digest reads tree_moved -- copal's third firing of that collision, booked on the card. 88 guards read green with three inherited reds, none mine.
